; Ad-blocking exceptions (RPZ, checked before the HaGeZi list; see
; unbound.conf). Applies to home, wireless and guest only.
;
; One entry per name that the list blocks but you want: `rpz-passthru.`
; answers it normally. Add the wildcard line too if subdomains are needed.
; Say why, like the IoT allowlist:
;
;   ; tracking link in the bank's emails, 2026-11
;   click.example.com      CNAME rpz-passthru.
;   *.click.example.com    CNAME rpz-passthru.
;
; Which rule blocked a name: podman logs unbound 2>&1 | grep 'rpz: adblock'
; Apply: copy to /bind/unbound/ on dns1, then `podman restart unbound`.
$TTL 3600
@ SOA localhost. root.localhost. 1 3600 600 86400 3600
  NS  localhost.
